[{"componentKey":"single-parent-income-composition","componentType":"composition-chart","title":"母子世帯の年間所得階級別構成","description":null,"componentProps":{"seriesRefs":[{"metricKey":"single-mother-households-income-under100","label":"母子世帯の所得100万円未満","colorRole":"series-1"},{"metricKey":"single-mother-households-income-100to199","label":"母子世帯の所得100〜199万円","colorRole":"series-2"},{"metricKey":"single-mother-households-income-200to299","label":"母子世帯の所得200〜299万円","colorRole":"series-3"},{"metricKey":"single-mother-households-income-300to399","label":"母子世帯の所得300〜399万円","colorRole":"series-4"},{"metricKey":"single-mother-households-income-400to499","label":"母子世帯の所得400〜499万円","colorRole":"series-5"},{"metricKey":"single-mother-households-income-500plus","label":"母子世帯の所得500万円以上","colorRole":"series-6"}],"annotation":"2022年就業構造基本調査。配偶者のいない母と18歳未満の子から成る世帯で、父子世帯や他の同居者がいる世帯は含みません。所得は2021年10月〜2022年9月の税込み年間収入です。構成比は表示した6階級の合計を分母とし、不詳込みの母子世帯総数との差は丸めを含むため不詳人数とは扱いません。平均所得や貧困率ではありません。","rankingLinks":[{"label":"母子世帯の所得100〜199万円の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/single-mother-households-income-100to199"},{"label":"母子世帯の所得200〜299万円の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/single-mother-households-income-200to299"},{"label":"母子世帯の所得300〜399万円の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/single-mother-households-income-300to399"},{"label":"母子世帯の所得400〜499万円の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/single-mother-households-income-400to499"},{"label":"母子世帯の所得500万円以上の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/single-mother-households-income-500plus"}]},"sourceName":"就業構造基本調査","sourceLink":"https://www.e-stat.go.jp/dbview?sid=0004008606","rankingLink":"/ranking/single-mother-households-income-under100","gridColumnSpan":12,"gridColumnSpanTablet":null,"gridColumnSpanSm":null,"dataSource":"ranking","section":"single-parent-households-overview","sortOrder":10}]